---
description: Dead-code detection. Always use Unreach MCP instead of guessing.
globs:
  - "**/*.py"
  - "**/*.ts"
  - "**/*.tsx"
alwaysApply: false
---

Do not guess unused or orphan code. Call MCP `unreach.scan`, then `unreach.plan`. Never delete files unless the user explicitly asks after reviewing the plan.
